.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/qantas-header-banner.jpg" title="Qantas" style="width: 680px;"></font></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001305E9C0" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001305EC20"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001305EE80"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001305F0E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001305F590"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001305F7F0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001305FA50"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001305FCB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000130604E0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013060740" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear Agency Partner,<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001305DBE0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="00000000130609A0">Thank you for submitting your query. It has been received by the Qantas Distribution Platform portal support team.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013060BE0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013060CF0">The support team will review your query and will be in touch within 1-2 business days.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013060F30"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013061040">If your query is related to a customer's booking and travel is within the next 24 hours, please contact the Qantas Agency Connect team in your country.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013061280"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013061390">Please note, Qantas Distribution Platform portal support team operating hours are:</font><ul data_liveedit_tagid="00000000130615D0" style="margin: 5px 0px 0px 40px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 1px; line-height: 20px;"><li data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013061830" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px 10px 0px 0px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">9am to 5pm, Monday to Friday AEST excluding NSW public holidays.</font></li></ul><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013061CF0">Thank you,<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013061F30"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013062040">Qantas Distribution Platform portal support team<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013062280"><em data_liveedit_tagid="00000000130624C0">Qantas Airways Limited</em><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013062850"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013062960"><strong data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013062BA0"><em data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013062CD0">Please do not reply to this email. This is an unmonitored account.</em></strong></font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000130632C0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013063520" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000130639E0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013063C40" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013065030"><td data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013065290" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="00000000130654F0" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="0000000013065750"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="00000000130659B0"